<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it launched on Tuesday 150 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$2.98	  PREMIUM	  16.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$0.0501	GEARING	  5.95 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  21.JAN.98	PAYDATE	  3.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     SINGAPORE	LISTING DATE   5.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$2.98	  MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p> NOTES		 CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF</p>
<p>			 STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
